    "title": "2026 Oscars tonight: Time, channel, RI nominations",
    "text": "TELEVISIONRI's Michael Shawver is up for an Oscar for 'Sinners.' How to watchSaman Shafiq Rin VelascoUSA TODAY NETWORK - New EnglandMarch 15, 2026, 5:07 a.m. ETGrab your popcorn, as the biggest night for movies is upon us.The 98th Academy Awards, celebrating the best movies of 2025 and the creatives who helped make them, are set to take place tonight, March 15.Leading the nominations for this year's ceremony is Ryan Coogler's popular gangster drama and vampire horror movie \"Sinners\" with 16 nominations, including Best Picture, Best Actor (Michael B. Jordan), Best Supporting Actress (Wunmi Mosaku) and Best Supporting Actor (Delroy Lindo). It breaks the previous record of 14, a feat shared by \"Titanic,\" \"All About Eve\" and \"La La Land.\"Our team of savvy editors independently handpicks all recommendations. If you purchase through our links, the USA TODAY Network may earn a commission. Prices were accurate at the time of publication but may change.",
